{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/940679-ghost-and-ghost-familiars","id":940679,"title":"Ghost and Ghost Familiars.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-31T10:22:24-07:00","id":940679,"title":"Ghost and Ghost Familiars.","content":"The invisible entities entry in the main book states that a ghost's influence involve their own anchors.<br /> 1.) Does this mean a ghost automatically has rank level influence on all its anchors, or does it divide its influence if it has more than one anchor?<br /> 2.) How useful is such influence? I can see some use if a ghost has influence 2: the house he died in, but what what use is influence 2: the cornerstone of a church, or :wedding ring?<br /> 3.) If a mage has a Ghost Familiar, does he effectively become another anchor for the ghost (otherwise the ghost couldn't follow him)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":532,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/532-newes","user":"Newes","date":". 07-31-2016, 01:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/532-newes","name":"Newes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar532_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-31T15:29:55-07:00","id":940880,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Newes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/940679-ghost-and-ghost-familiars#post940679\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The invisible entities entry in the main book states that a ghost's influence involve their own anchors.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hoo boy, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/71851-unpacking-manifestation-conditions\">this again</a>.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 1.) Does this mean a ghost automatically has rank level influence on all its anchors, or does it divide its influence if it has more than one anchor? </div> </div> </div>A ghost starts with [an] Influence[s] relating to the circumstances surrounding the Anchor Condition[s] its genesis spawned.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 2.) How useful is such influence? I can see some use if a ghost has influence 2: the house he died in, but what what use is influence 2: the cornerstone of a church, or :wedding ring? </div> </div> </div>Influences are nonspecific and ghostly influences in particular are often emotional or abstract; your examples are all example specimens of the Anchor Condition of their respective ghosts.<br /> <br /> A ghost who died in a home invasion might be anchored to their house by Fear or Anger, while the church-dwelling ghost might be bound there by Faith or Architecture, and the wedding ring might chain a ghost to the land of the living through Love or Desperation.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 3.) If a mage has a Ghost Familiar, does he effectively become another anchor for the ghost (otherwise the ghost couldn't follow him)? </div> </div> </div>Anchors aren't a hard geographical lock in 2e and the only thing stopping a ghost from wandering beyond the range of its anchors doesn't happen to ephemeral beings with the Familiar Condition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-31T17:42:48-07:00","id":940963,"title":"","content":"Although, to clarify 3 a bit further, no the Mage isn't an anchor for a ghost.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-31T18:20:36-07:00","id":940977,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/940679-ghost-and-ghost-familiars?p=940880#post940880\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hoo boy, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/71851-unpacking-manifestation-conditions\">this again</a>.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div> In retrospect I should have searched the general WOD forum. I deal almost exclusively so it just didn't occur to me. Thanks for the info!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/532-newes","name":"Newes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar532_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-31T18:21:48-07:00","id":940978,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/940679-ghost-and-ghost-familiars?p=940963#post940963\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Although, to clarify 3 a bit further, no the Mage isn't an anchor for a ghost.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks. I have trouble shrugging off 1e rules. I still occasionally find myself adding up successes when calculating spell effects that use potency instead of reducing dice pools.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":532,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/532-newes","user":"Newes","date":". 07-31-2016, 09:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/532-newes","name":"Newes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar532_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"194"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-31T18:45:15-07:00","id":940987,"title":"","content":"Notably, the quote about all ghosts having &quot;Influence: Anchors&quot; was directly copied from the God Machine Chronicle rules update. The same quote appeared in the advance PDF of the Chronicles of Darkness core rulebook, but was removed in the errata stage and is not in the final version. It's seemingly a copy error stemming from an artifact of an early draft of the 2e ephemeral entities rules. Hopefully it will be removed from Mage as it was from CofD.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}